{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"f13d7b9a-b34a-4cea-a7d7-ec3aa0875bc3","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已读取问题空间文件。现在进行语义分割和 vault 搜索。\n\n## Step 1: 语义分割\n\n| 节点 | 原文片段 | 逻辑角色 | 核心概念 | 长匹配 query |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|-------------|\n| S1 | PIM与DRAM/RERAM等新型存储-计算融合集成的关键设计方法 | 核心机制/对象 | PIM architecture, DRAM-PIM, RERAM crossbar, near-memory computing | `\"Processing-in-Memory\" \"near-memory computing\" architecture` |\n| S2 | MoE expert权重驻留、KV cache存取 | 模型负载/应用场景 | expert weight residency, KV cache offloading | `\"expert weight\" KV-cache MoE PIM` |\n| S3 | DiT 迭代状态缓存 | 模型负载/应用场景 | diffusion iteration, state caching | `diffusion iteration \"state caching\" DiT` |\n| S4 | 多模态 跨模态特征存取 | 模型负载/应用场景 | multi-modal, cross-modal feature access | `multimodal \"cross-modal\" feature access memory` |\n| S5 | Video 帧级特征缓存 | 模型负载/应用场景 | video frame-level feature caching | `video \"frame-level\" feature caching` |\n| S6 | 多算子/微算子并发 + 近存计算减少数据搬运开销 | 计算场景/核心问题 | multi-operator concurrency, near-memory, data movement reduction | `\"near-memory\" \"data movement\" concurrency` |\n| S7 | 提升并发吞吐 | 目标/指标 | concurrency throughput, PIM performance | `PIM throughput concurrency TOPS-W` |\n\nNow let me search all four directories with multiple levels. Let me start with Level A (long match) searches for each node."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":20924,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6319ec9d-4e39-437a-9e1d-6f68558f0d09","uuid":"fa9b8459-9f15-47bd-8e2f-804bc04dd165"}
