":\"PIM\",\"offset\":1226},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":1310},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":1344},{\"match\":\"PIM可在内存侧高效计算\",\"offset\":1374},{\"match\":\"Inference\",\"offset\":1411}],\"excerpt\":\"## PIM (Processing-in-Memory) for MoE\\n术语解释\\n存内计算（PIM）是将计算逻辑集成到内存芯片内部的架构方案，在MoE推理中使用PIM处理计算密度低但内存访问密集的expert操作，与GPU形成互补。\\n术语是什么？\\nDuplex是代表性的MoE PIM方案：\\n- 结合xPU（传统计算单元，如GPU）和Logic PIM（存内逻辑处理单元）\\n- 两种处理单元共享设备内存，通过高带宽TSV（Through-Silicon Via）实现DRAM die和Logic die间通信\\n- 关键洞察：不同操作有不同的Op/B（每字节操作数）特性：\\n  - Attention…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Processing-in-Memory (PIM) for LLM MoE Inference（面向LLM MoE推理的存内计算）.md\",\"basename\":\"Processing-in-Memory (PIM) for LLM MoE Inference（面向LLM MoE推理的存内计算）\",\"score\":5050.2424260088765,\"foundWords\":[\"pim\",\"pim，在\",\"processing-in-memory\",\"processing\",\"in\",\"insights\",\"inference（面向llm\",\"inference\",\"memory\",\"memory-bound\",\"processing-in-memory\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Processing-in-Memory\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":25},{\"match\":\"Inference（面向LLM\",\"offset\":42},{\"match\":\"Processing-in-Memory\",\"offset\":115},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":137},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":206},{\"match\":\"memory-bound\",\"offset\":255},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":309},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":340},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":356},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":486},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":501},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":511},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":564},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":608},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":648},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":717},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":732},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":850},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":912},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":929},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":1017},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":1035},{\"match\":\"PIM，在\",\"offset\":1070},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1076},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":1152},{\"match\":\"memory-bound\",\"offset\":1176},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1219},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1252},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1255},{\"match\":\"Inference\",\"offset\":1263},{\"match\":\"Insights\",\"offset\":1286}],\"excerpt\":\"## Processing-in-Memory (PIM) for LLM MoE Inference（面向LLM MoE推理的存内计算）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nProcessing-in-Memory (PIM) 是一种将计算逻辑放置在内存（DRAM/HBM）内部或紧邻位置的架构，通过减少数据搬运距离来降低内存带宽瓶颈。对于 LLM 推理，PIM 利用其远高于 GPU 的有效内存带宽（因计算单元靠近存储单元，数据传输路径短），特别适合 memory-bound 的计算任务。Duplex (MICRO 2024) 是代表性 HBM-…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/3D Near-Memory Processing (3D NMP) for MoE LLM Inference.md\",\"basename\":\"3D Near-Memory Processing (3D NMP) for MoE LLM Inference\",\"score\":1466.0107492180596,\"foundWords\":[\"pim\",\"pims\",\"processing-in-memory\",\"processing\",\"in\",\"intermediate\",\"interconnect**：节点间通过\",\"interconnect\",\"inference\",\"memory\",\"memory、分布式\",\"processing-in-memory\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Memory\",\"offset\":11},{\"match\":\"Processing\",\"offset\":18},{\"match\":\"Inference\",\"offset\":50},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":88},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":196},{\"match\":\"Memory\",\"offset\":262},{\"match\":\"Processing\",\"offset\":269},{\"match\":\"Processing-in-Memory\",\"offset\":329},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":351},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":399},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":534},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":559},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":566},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":895},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":946},{\"match\":\"Interconnect**：节点间通过\",\"offset\":988},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1080},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1281},{\"match\":\"memory、分布式\",\"offset\":1343},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1365},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1390},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":1451},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1563},{\"match\":\"PIMs\",\"offset\":1604},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1729},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1763},{\"match\":\"intermediate\",\"offset\":1800},{\"match\":\"Memory\",\"offset\":2027},{\"match\":\"Processing\",\"offset\":2034}],\"excerpt\":\"## 3D Near-Memory Processing (3D NMP) for MoE LLM Inference\\n术语解释\\n3D NMP 是通过 Hybrid Bonding 技术将 DRAM die 垂直堆叠在逻辑 die 之上，利用高密度 Cu-Cu 直接键合互连提供高带宽、高能效的近存计算架构。与 GPU 共享内存架构不同，3D NMP 中每个计算节点拥有独立的 local memory bank，通过 2D mesh NoC 互联，形成分布式内存+分布式计算的计算环境。\\n术语是什么？\\n3D Near-Memory Processing (3D NMP) 是一种将 DRAM 存储垂直堆叠在逻辑计算芯…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/AiMX PIM Architecture.md\",\"basename\":\"AiMX PIM Architecture\",\"score\":788.1466840121846,\"foundWords\":[\"pim\",\"pimphony通过mlir\",\"pimphony:\",\"pimphony\",\"pim部署。\",\"pim部署\",\"pim-based\",\"属于processing-in-memory\",\"processing-in-memory\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":8},{\"match\":\"属于Processing-in-Memory\",\"offset\":112},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":135},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":612},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":800},{\"match\":\"PIMphony\",\"offset\":1080},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":1113},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":1383},{\"match\":\"PIMphony通过MLIR\",\"offset\":1620},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":1645},{\"match\":\"PIM\",\"offset\":1701},{\"match\":\"PIM部署。\",\"offset\":1733},{\"match\":\"PIMphony:\",\"offset\":1751},{\"match\":\"PIM-based\",\"offset\":1811}],\"excerpt\":\"## AiMX PIM Architecture\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nAiMX是SK hynix基于GDDR6-AiM (Accelerator-in-Memory) 芯片构建的AI加速卡产品线，属于Processing-in-Memory（PIM）的商业化实现。GDDR6-AiM芯片在标准GDDR6 DRAM的每个bank内嵌入MAC（Multiply-Accumulate）和AF（Activation Function）计算单元，使内存芯片本身能够执行计算。AiMX卡将多个GDDR6-AiM芯片组合到PCIe加速卡上——2024年升级版为32GB容量，支持Llama 3 70B…\"}],\"totalCount\":5,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"path:knowledge_notes PIM \\\"processing-in-memory\\\"\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6319ec9d-4e39-437a-9e1d-6f68558f0d09","uuid":"1a01efdf-3407-453b-a79e-ba9fcee1608b","timestamp":"2026-05-31T11:48:01.535Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/DRAM-Based Processing-in-Memory (PIM).md\",\"basename\":\"DRAM-Based Processin