{"match":"KV","offset":1215},{"match":"Cache","offset":1218}],"excerpt":"## Write-Through KV Cache（写通KV缓存）\n术语是什么？\nWrite-Through KV Cache是TokenFlow提出的KV cache内存管理策略，将GPU显存视为CPU memory上大容量KV cache的**高速缓存层**。与普通write-back策略（仅在显存压力或请求完成时写回KV cache到host）不同，write-through在**每次decode iteration后**都将新生成的KV chunk异步同步到host memory。这使抢占时大部分KV cache已预先同步，剩余未同步chunk极小，上下文切换延迟大幅降低。\n属于GPU作为cache、CPU作为b…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/KV Cache Reload Overhead in Chunked Prefill（分块预填充中的KV Cache重复加载开销）.md","basename":"KV Cache Reload Overhead in Chunked Prefill（分块预填充中的KV Cache重复加载开销）","score":725.3243842942298,"foundWords":["kv","cache","cache读取：attention中每层读取已计算的kv，无需重复","cache读取","cache写入：每层1次，共l层","cache写入","cache重复加载开销）","cache重复加载开销","cache重复读取（n为chunk数量），而非unchunked","cache重复读取","cache，减少hbm往返","cache。这导致近似"],"matches":[{"match":"KV","offset":3},{"match":"Cache","offset":6},{"match":"KV","offset":54},{"match":"Cache重复加载开销）","offset":57},{"match":"KV","offset":79},{"match":"Cache","offset":82},{"match":"KV","offset":192},{"match":"cache。这导致近似","offset":195},{"match":"KV","offset":217},{"match":"cache重复读取（N为chunk数量），而非unchunked","offset":220},{"match":"KV","offset":408},{"match":"Cache","offset":411},{"match":"KV","offset":496},{"match":"cache写入：每层1次，共L层","offset":499},{"match":"KV","offset":519},{"match":"cache读取：attention中每层读取已计算的KV，无需重复","offset":522},{"match":"KV","offset":701},{"match":"cache","offset":704},{"match":"KV","offset":732},{"match":"KV","offset":777},{"match":"KV","offset":811},{"match":"KV","offset":858},{"match":"KV","offset":875},{"match":"KV","offset":917},{"match":"KV","offset":1062},{"match":"KV","offset":1250},{"match":"cache","offset":1253},{"match":"KV","offset":1293},{"match":"cache","offset":1296},{"match":"KV","offset":1534},{"match":"cache，减少HBM往返","offset":1537}],"excerpt":"## KV Cache Reload Overhead in Chunked Prefill（分块预填充中的KV Cache重复加载开销）\n术语是什么？\nKV Cache Reload Overhead是chunked prefill调度策略下的一个性能缺陷：当长prefill被拆分为多个chunk后，第i个chunk的attentio