memory\",\"offset\":5288}],\"excerpt\":\"## RPU - A Reasoning Processing Unit\\n- baseline方法是什么？\\n  Baseline是NVIDIA H100/H200 GPU系统上的低batch LLM decode推理。H100系统特征：(1) 内存层使用HBM3e（如单个stack 1280GB/s、48GB、BW/Cap≈27），带宽和容量强绑定，大量容量在低batch decode中未使用；(2) 系统层为monolithic die设计，compute-to-bandwidth ratio约200 OPs/Byte，仅30-40% TDP分给memory interface，decode时大量compute/cache…\"},{\"filename\":\"idea_notes/ZipServ_ Fast and Memory-Efficient LLM Inference with Hardware-Aware Lossless Compression.md\",\"basename\":\"ZipServ_ Fast and Memory-Efficient LLM Inference with Hardware-Aware Lossless Compression\",\"score\":568.4821478842464,\"foundWords\":[\"processing\",\"indicator\",\"integer/popcount/shuffle指令，无分支、无shared\",\"integer\",\"intensity从decoupled的严重退化提升至约50%高于标准gemm，将bandwidth\",\"intensity从decoupled的严重退化提升至约50\",\"intensity相比标准gemm下降62.0%（batch\",\"intensity相比标准gemm下降62\",\"interleaving，tensor\",\"interleaving\",\"inference\",\"memory\",\"memory自动分配给kv\",\"memory传输与计算。fine-level：slice-wise\",\"memory传输与计算\",\"memory-efficient\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Memory-Efficient\",\"offset\":21},{\"match\":\"Inference\",\"offset\":42},{\"match\":\"inference\",\"offset\":202},{\"match\":\"processing\",\"offset\":353},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":387},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":638},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":861},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":886},{\"match\":\"intensity相比标准GEMM下降62.0%（batch\",\"offset\":917},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":975},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1076},{\"match\":\"integer\",\"offset\":1391},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1558},{\"match\":\"memory自动分配给KV\",\"offset\":2057},{\"match\":\"memory传输与计算。Fine-level：slice-wise\",\"offset\":2397},{\"match\":\"interleaving，Tensor\",\"offset\":2431},{\"match\":\"indicator\",\"offset\":2643},{\"match\":\"integer/popcount/shuffle指令，无分支、无shared\",\"offset\":2775},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":2814},{\"match\":\"inference\",\"offset\":3155},{\"match\":\"Intensity从decoupled的严重退化提升至约50%高于标准GEMM，将bandwidth\",\"offset\":3413}],\"excerpt\":\"## ZipServ: Fast and Memory-Efficient LLM Inference with Hardware-Aware Lossless Compression\\n- baseline方法是什么？\\n  Baseline是现有lossless compression方法（DFloat11/Huffman、DietGPU/rANS、nvCOMP/rANS）集成到decoupled inference pipeline中。全栈执行例子：算法层使用Huffman或ANS entropy coding对BF16 weight exponent field进行变长编码→编译框架层无特殊修改，使用标准NVCC编译→kerne…\"},{\"filename\":\"idea_notes/HD-MoE_ Hybrid and Dynamic Parallelism for Mixture-of-Expert LLMs with 3D Near-Memory Processing.md\",\"basename\":\"HD-MoE_ Hybrid and Dynamic Parallelism for Mixture-of-Expert LLMs with 3D Near-Memory Processing\",\"score\":537.2149795017579,\"foundWords\":[\"processing\",\"intermediate\",\"instruct\",\"memory\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Memory\",\"offset\":82},{\"match\":\"Processing\",\"offset\":89},{\"match\":\"Instruct\",\"offset\":295},{\"match\":\"intermediate\",\"offset\":591},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1417},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1470}],\"excerpt\":\"## HD-MoE: Hybrid and Dynamic Parallelism for Mixture-of-Expert LLMs with 3D Near-Memory Processing\\n- baseline方法是什么？\\n  - **Tensor Parallelism (TP)、Expert Parallelism (EP)、Hybrid TP-EP with Compute-Balanced**。这三种策略是现有 GPU 集群和分布式系统上部署 MoE 模型的标准并行策略，但在 3D NMP 架构上各有根本缺陷。\\n  - 全栈执行例子（以 Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct 在 3D NMP 4×4 mesh 上推理为例）：\\n    - **模型推理算法层**：Mixtral-8x7B, 32 MoE layers, 8 exp…\"},{\"filename\":\"idea_notes/Associative_Recurrent_Memory_Transformer.md\",\"basename\":\"Associative_Recurrent_Memory_Transformer\",\"score\":409.6228027494462,\"foundWords\":[\"processing\",\"processing，无并行化。\",\"processing（论文承认\\\"lack\",\"instruct推理时生成一个token\",\"instruct\",\"memory\",\"memory。ahn仅在l\",\"memory。\",\"memory），两者互补。ssm无此双记忆系统。\",\"memory），同时关联记忆提供对遥远历史的结构化访问（类似long-term\",\"memory（delta-rule）的层间关联记忆模块。核心创新：\",\"将memory\",\"。memory\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Memory\",\"offset\":25},{\"match\":\"Memory\",\"offset\":87},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":157},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":197},{\"match\":\"。Memory\",\"offset\":247},{\"match\":\"将memory\",\"offset\":446},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":578},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":629},{\"match\":\"。Memory\",\"offset\":686},{\"match\":\"processing，无并行化。\",\"offset\":830},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":988},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1052},{\"match\":\"Memory\",\"offset\":1200},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1228},{\"match\":\"Memory\",\"offset\":1463},{\"match\":\"memory（delta-rule）的层间关联记忆模块。核心创新：\",\"offset\":1547},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1599},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":1767},{\"match\":\"Memor\",\"offset\":1887},{\"match\":\"的memor\",\"offset\":1913},{\"match\":\"Processin\",\"offset\":2058},{\"match\":\"Memor\",\"offset\":2205},{\"match\":\"的memor\",\"offset\":2225},{\"match\":\"t processi\",\"offset\":2639},{\"match\":\"t-memo\",\"offset\":2839},{\"match\":\"替代memo\",\"offset\":3026},{\"match\":\"T memo\",\"offset\":3100},{\"match\":\"4个memo\",\"offset\":3118},{\"match\":\"ng memory），同时关联记忆提供对遥远历史的结构化访问（类似long-t\",\"offset\":3902},{\"match\":\"rm memory），两者互补。SSM无此双记忆\",\"offset\":3942},{\"match\":\"有层间mem\",\"offset\":3982},{\"match\":\".5-Instr\",\"offset\":4127},{\"match\":\"ss mem\",\"offset\":4354},{\"match\":\"3B-Instr\",\"offset\":4460},{\"match\":\"rm memory。AHN\",\"offset\":5629},{\"match\":\"3B-Instruct推理时生成一个to\",\"offset\":5716},{\"match\":\"WL)。Mem\",\"offset\":6267},{\"match\":\"序列下mem\",\"offset\":7111}],\"excerpt\":\"## Associative_Recurrent_Memory_Transformer\\n- baseline方法是什么？\\n  Baseline是RMT（Recurrent Memory Transformer），一种基于segment-level recurrence的Transformer扩展。RMT使用特殊memory tokens在segment间传递信息：每个segment处理后，memory tokens作为下一segment的额外输入token，实现跨segment的信息流动。Memory tokens的hidden states通过Transformer的self-attention与当前segment所有token交互，然后…\"},{\"filename\":\"idea_notes/FastKV_ KV Cache Compression for Fast Long-Context Processing with Token-Selective Propagation.md\",\"basename\":\"FastKV_ KV Cache Compression for Fast Long-Context Processing with Token-S